OL,3,GNEWSAParents of children harmed by drug
OL,4,Afearful for future
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple from Bognor Regis whose
OL,7,Fchildren were harmed by an epilepsy
OL,8,Fdrug used during pregnancy have said
OL,9,Fthey fear for the future as the wait
OL,10,Ffor financial redress goes on.
OL,12,FJanet Stockley-Pollard, who took sodium
OL,13,Fvalproate, branded as Epilim, during
OL,14,Fall her pregnancies, said she was
OL,15,Funaware of its side effects at the
OL,16,Ftime.
OL,18,FAll four of her children have been
OL,19,Faffected, and the Stockley-Pollards are
OL,20,Famong those campaigning for
OL,21,Fcompensation in line with two separate
OL,22,Frecommendations.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
