OL,3,GNEWSAParents of children harmed by drug
OL,4,Afearful for future
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,7,FCare (DHSC) said a decision on
OL,8,Ffinancial redress had not yet been
OL,9,Fmade, while manufacturer Sanofi said it
OL,10,Funderstood "the concerns of persons
OL,11,Faffected".
